# secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# VITE_ vars are bundled into the client JS regardless of where they're set,
# so this one is public, not a secret -- Vercel's build picks it up
# automatically (deploy/README.md).
!frontend/.env.production
# A template with real non-secret values and obvious placeholders for real
# ones -- never the actual production .env (deploy/CHECKLIST.md B5).
!deploy/.env.production.example

